Z||000000||JBGehling||12-05-2000||09:12 PM||||Hey,  <BR>   I just finished paying off some debts (I use that term loosely... I'm only 15  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">) so I have a good deal of extra cash coming in (about $400 saved up right now). I was examining my options and I think a radar detector is a really nice way to blow it  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif">. <P>Some questions here<P>1) What's the top of the line radar detector? I heard some talk of a Valentine (or something like that?)<P>2) Does anyone have a link to the Valentine (sp) detectors for on line ordering?<P>3) how much do really good detectors run?<P>4) Does it only pick up a radar when it's on you, or when it's in the general area?<P>Thanks,<BR>Josh<P>||||reg||5
